# Generated prompt corpora contain raw third-party chat text harvested from
# real users (committed Claude Code transcripts, WildChat, LMSYS). That text can
# include pasted secrets (API keys) and PII, and GitHub push protection will
# (rightly) block it. Keep ALL raw corpora and readable samples OUT of the repo
# — they are fully reproducible from the scripts. Commit only the aggregate
# *_stats.json (counts, no raw text).

# Raw corpora (any source)
*_corpus.json
# ...but the classified spectrum STATS are safe aggregates — keep those.
!*_stats.json

# Readable samples (contain raw prompt text)
*_sample.txt

# Iteration backups
*.backup.json
